@prefix ex: <urn:test:owl-dl:> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<urn:test:owl-dl:inherited-conflict> a owl:Ontology .
ex:LivingThing a owl:Class ; owl:disjointWith ex:Device .
ex:Person a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:LivingThing .
ex:Device a owl:Class .
ex:conflicted a owl:NamedIndividual, ex:Person, ex:Device .
